 This is the 4.4BSD license of the University of California, Berkeley
 ("BSD-4-Clause-UC" in SPDX). Several of the files under it come from BSD
 Unix (ip.h, ip6.h, ipproto.h, nameser.h, nfs.h, tcp.h and udp.h carry
